Common Issues & Solutions
Issue	Solution
Image not found	Check file path and extension
Window doesn't open	Ensure OpenCV is properly installed
Wrong colors	Remember OpenCV uses BGR, not RGB
Shapes not visible	Check if drawing is happening before or after blank image creation
